.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fOCef-jg-PwQ7kNvwGusIxk&_nc_oc=AdoabqWQlSX5IBZYkcN3Z0XaypUDo3v7tn387gCJavAGVSzem0oODXkQqKU-gPhI5ps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwlup-SoTxMQkWzPNHY84wYKDGFygg0KQuqY0nAmTfkQ&oe=6B0481F7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Australian Open VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Who says the best seats in the house are court side?  The Australian Open VR app gives you unprecedented access to the very center of tennis action: the Rod Laver Arena. \n\nWith this app, you get:\n- Immersive multi-camera action from the Rod Laver Arena for all matches.\n- An interactive \"Director's Chair\" , where you get to select the best camera from the AO2021 Rod Laver Arena TV production to follow the action the way you like it.\n- Highlights and featured content for the tournament.\n\nContent available only for users in Japan.\n", "short_description": "The Australian Open VR app is your ticket to the best immersive and interactive experience from the Rod Laver Arena. Content available only for users in Japan.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "748208292787655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568674_748208299454321_9199275796024111845_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6yEmCtHo9owQ7kNvwEjgRy2&_nc_oc=AdrM7eD3pyrLR8XdLpwZDtS35D2LoakfZpHCK96a-RysztTw-ps_uZ6iaOViaGiMK70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTHfMdGNLQKXGcymTB1IsLUnVsE8ly4XCrLKniAMaN7GQ&oe=6B046679"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "704643830420157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230051_704643833753490_981048534016631306_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JwUAEcO1L1QQ7kNvwE026uf&_nc_oc=Adpwqcq-CKX0